Subject: [PATCH] Keep geometry recurrence authored while reusing native draws

Evaluate geometry once, preserve authored rasterization in feedback, and replay
prepared vertices for native presentation. Reuse existing canvas targets and
restore per-vertex shape input state after instanced native lines.

